3. Performance Trick for Fast Allocation

Instead of scanning allocation ledger every time, we rely on:

unutilized_amt

Query used by UI:

SELECT
hedge_id,
loan_id,
unutilized_amt
FROM CLO_HEDGE
WHERE loan_id = :loan_id
AND status='OPEN'
AND unutilized_amt > 0
ORDER BY created_date;

This is extremely fast because of index.

Index

CREATE INDEX IDX_HEDGE_OPEN_POOL
ON CLO_HEDGE(loan_id, status, unutilized_amt);

No ledger scanning required.


